\int_e \[(\cof  D^2 w)\] \{\!\{D v\}\!\} \phi  \,d s \\\notag
& \qquad \qquad \quad  + \sum_{e \in \mathcal{E}_h^i } \int_e \[\{\!\{\cof D^2 v \}\!\} D w \] \phi
\,d s .
